2026-07-27T08:54:32.7411453Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:54:32.7412115Z i /tmp/RtmpieGoOY/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:54:32.7412580Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:54:32.7413149Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:54:32.7414079Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:54:32.7414814Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:54:32.7415870Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:54:32.7416603Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:54:32.7671948Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:54:32.7778545Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:54:32.8244312Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:54:32.8422030Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
